# apps/dashboard

- French UI. Cookie session `ceraghit_admin`; `proxy.ts` redirects to `/login`. Server reads go through `admin()` in `lib/api.ts`.
- Only `/api/rpc/admin/*` and `/api/files/*` are proxied (`DASHBOARD_ALLOWED`).
- Product form: two price inputs (TND dinars, EUR euros), both required, converted with `toMinor`/`fromMinor`. FR text required, EN/AR optional.
- Images upload straight to the bucket through `admin.uploads.sign` (presigned PUT), never through the api body.
- Stats show TND and EUR separately, never summed. Destructive actions confirm and say what happens to stock.
- Unique-piece requests are answered by the owner by email himself: show email, copy button and `mailto:`, send nothing.
